Description: lightweight process manager and system monitor
 RunningManager is a desktop process manager and system monitor built with
 Dear ImGui. It lists running processes with PID, status, user, elevated
 privileges, CPU and memory usage, and supports sorting, searching, killing
 processes, bringing application windows to the front, and opening the
 executable location.
 .
 The system summary shows CPU, memory, disk and, when supported by the
 driver, GPU usage. The UI is available in light blue and light pink themes
 and automatically uses a CJK font when one is installed.
